ans, and credit cards. It also develops Insurance Hub, a cloud-based platform that provides a suite of APIs offering access to a broad catalogue of insurance products, KYC services, and a transformation and rules engine; Integration Studio, a developer-centric environment that supports the entire lifecycle of API integrations; Ninja SalesPro app, a tool designed for relationship managers; Turtlemint Academy, a digital learning and development platform designed to enhance the knowledge, skills, and productivity; TurtlemintPro, a tool for digital partners, providing access to income-generating opportunities and avenues for professional development; Turtlefin, an embedded insurance and SaaS solutions for banks, NBFCs, insurers, and e-commerce platforms; and Turtlemint Consumer App, an application for customers to manage their policies, track benefits, and handle claims. Turtlemint Fintech Solutions Limited was incorporated in 2015 and is based in Mumbai, India.","employees":1173,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795210789},"analyst":{"key":"strong_buy","mean":1,"n":2,"tMean":97.5,"tHigh":120,"tLow":75,"tMed":97.5,"currency":"INR","asOf":1795210789,"trend":{"strongBuy":0,"buy":2,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}},"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795210789,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Turtlemint Fintech Solutions\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Turtlemint Fintech Solutions Ltd. Share Price Live Today","s":"CNBC TV18","d":1795168800,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxORmhHcnJLWmh6ak0tMlNjNWI1bENlbzI0TjQ0bU1IZWhJQUY4M1FmUUtyemlRUTJCVENhV3praDFVT05MaW9acVV5aW5Rdzg0VG9WNUU5R05laUR2MEhOMVRJN1JhcVBVVmpuOUFhc2I4ZE41bjdWNHR5UUJTV1o4STBRem0zM3M2cGVHN3ZaNVNnT1FTYkE?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Turtlemint Fintech Solutions Ltd is Rated Strong Sell","s":"MarketsMojo","d":1795063407,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxOREJQZjNJX1BqLVQ5NnY5QVR4R05LZTh0OGp3M01IREVLejlZTDRXYTR